| Network egress | none required. RC01 `offline_fixture` external request cap 0 (CD:62). Pushes are git-over-network, and Luke's word is needed | cargo `--offline` with a vendored bundle (FC1:57). The musl target download was one official fetch (DR:1776) | none |
